iography sentences score near 1; the 1% threshold is low (about 0.0051). Very short or badly extracted texts can show high flagged shares.","One training run (one seed). Classifications are model outputs, not conclusions about authorship."],"counting":{"mode":"all","include_bibliography":true,"include_appendices":true,"label":"All sentences","note":"Sentences in bibliographies and appendices are found from the extracted text (research/atlas-bib-exclusion-20261008/bib.py); the threshold is recalibrated on the human papers with the same sentences left out. Document-level curves use whole documents in every mode."},"curves_note":"Checked for leakage: 1,196 edited rows were removed because their paper is in the training data or they share a sequence of 10 or more words with it; 5,049 rows remain. This model was chosen among the October 10 training runs partly on its scores on these held-out edit sets, so these curves may be slightly optimistic."}